 "kind": "refuse",
 "message": "Hi Rachel, I can't file this one. Under POL-ACC-01, access requests can be filed by the employee themselves or by their direct manager. Nobody else can file on someone's behalf. Alex Chen (E010) reports to Marcus Webb (E009), not to you.\n\nOptions:\n- Alex can ask the helpdesk for BI access himself.\n- Marcus Webb, as Alex's manager, can ask the helpdesk to file the request.\n\nFor what it's worth, Alex is a full-time employee, so he is eligible for BI under POL-ACC-02. Standard-system requests are approved by the employee's manager, usually within 1 business day.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-ACC-01",
  "POL-ACC-02"
 ]
}
